                            <comment id="16034679" author="hudson" created="Fri, 2 Jun 2017 13:24:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;SUCCESS: Integrated in Jenkins build bookkeeper-master #1772 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/bookkeeper-master/1772/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/bookkeeper-master/1772/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
